<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Uibrani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur umbɔ aka atsɛnge abi Uibrani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uibrani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uibr</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur umbɔ aka atsɛnge abi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uibrani</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Uibrani</para>
  <para style="ip">Anasi ihwɛngmbɔ unerwi aka atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ. Anera akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ aka atsɛngmbɔ ubvur uwurɛ ri Iya-Num ru Urusharhima idɔrhi isipa ra amɛk aki 70 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Atsɛng ubvur ha ri ivangyɛ abika adɔsa abɔɔ, abi Uyahuda, aka atirhi ikorhe ikpũ amɛn rakɔ ugɛɛ ani irhɛm umbɔ ugɛ umbɔ abɔre imangmangmbɔ. Idɛ̃ɛ̃ iwengge ugɛ abika adɔsa ha awe ru uver. Atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ afituwe ikpũ aner abɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubvur uwurɛ udɛyiwe ugɛ igɔng nu ijee Uyesu inangngge iyi ípfu itser-Num, nu Umusa, nu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num, nu Akagɔng Abika Adzowe Idɛm-Num uwu ibibemuwe iyiki igbe. Itser ififɔrhyɛ Unum aka atsu ngge itsuifɛr ru ubok akpe Uyesu ngge iwu udĩ ififɔrh ha Unum aka agbisha udzur ri inggbaashia. Idzowe idɛm-Num nu ízũwã iyi ibibemuwe iyiki igbe kishoo iwe nyaka ri itsi akpe Uyesu. Awu ru ubok ibiba Uyesu umbɔ aka adzowe ibibemuwe iyiki ifa, iyiriyɛ iki iwu iyiki izea. Ri imimasha, ubvur ha ikɛi ufituwe imangmang abika adɔsa nggu iker akarhãrhã ru nyaku nggaa abi imangmang aka akorhe ru utsutson abi Uisrairha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Uyesu adɛyiwe iwiwe Unum <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1.1-3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uyesu ananga ípfu itser-Num <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1.4—2.18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uyesu ananga abika asɔm Arherhu-Num <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3.1—4.13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Itser iyiki idzowe idɛm-Num iyi Uyesu inangge iyi Uharuna <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4.14—7.28</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ibibemuwe iyiki ifa inangge iyiki igbe <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 8:1-10:18">8.1—10.18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ugar imangmang <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 10:19-12:29">10.19—12.29</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imimasha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HEB 13:1-25">13.1-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Ungwɛ̃wi aka ananga ípfu itser-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Isha, Unum arherhe arherhe nggu atokamɛn ra angwĩ abika asɔm Arherhu-Num ri ivanga irhɛirhɛ ra atsĩndĩã arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Bɔr ri ivang iyiki imimasha iyɛrɛ unga arherhuwa umɛn arherhe ra angwĩ Ungwɛ̃nga. Unga aka atsũ unga awe uner ukam abina kishoo. Ru ubok ungwɛ̃ hã Unum aka amunu upfunga ikɛi. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Ungwɛ̃ hã unga adɛyiwe irhirhang Unum na awe uzirhzĩ Unum, na awu icaica nggu unga. Unga akpɔm abina kishoo ra arherhanga aki ijee. Unga aka amaa igbishu utsĩndĩ uwuku usorhe arhim, unga aseisa ru ubok ugha Uwuku Ugɔnga ra afã. <verse eid="HEB 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Nggee unga ananga ípfu itser-Num, rimi hã, itsokyɛ umbɔ aka adzowe unga inangke ikimbɔ.<verse eid="HEB 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Awu ipfu itser-Num iyikisong Unum aka ayisa ngge agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;Ungo uwu Ungwɛ̃mum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">irherɛ umum iwu Utɛngo?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Amb 2.7</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Use ikɛi unga agɔr ngge agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;Umum iwuri iwu Utɛnga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">nu unga awu ungwɛ̃mum?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Nu ikɛi, ivangyɛ Unum aka akũ ukã ungwɛ̃nga aba ru upfung, unga agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">&lt;&lt;Uneke kishoo ípfu itser-Num idzowe unga igɔng.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Usm 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1Ats 17.13</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Arherhi ípfu itser-Num, unga agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">&lt;&lt;Unga atsu ípfu itsernga ngge iwe ru nyaku ugba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">na atsu umbɔ awe ru nyaki ikonrha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">ri itseryɛ umbɔ aki itɔ̃we unga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Amb 104.4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Bɔr ru Ungwɛ̃nga unga agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">&lt;&lt;A Unum, Iyɛrhango iwuri iwu ugbagbaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">nu ungo uwuri ikũ igbong iyiki igha Iyɛrhango</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">ukũ ugha Iyɛrhe idzidzɛrhe.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Ungo uku ubemu ubɛn irhirhika nu ukpɛ̃ɔ ubɛn iki ibewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">nggee, Unumngo aka atsu ungo unango awɛrhango</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ri idzukuwa ungo atsei anggɔm.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 45:6">Amb 45.6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 45:7">7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Ikɛi unga agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">&lt;&lt;Utirhi ri inggbaashia, A Uteijee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">awu ungo udzin atarh idzin abĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">nu afã awu itser abokngo.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Umbɔ awuri itsĩme ake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">bɔr ungo uwuri iwe umɔ ubɛn ivang.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Umbɔ awuri ishaka ugɛɛ atorho aka agbe.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Ungo uwuri ifeta ake ugɛɛ atorho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">awuri ifara ake ru nyaka umbɔ iki ifaru untama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Bɔr ungo uwe ru nyaka ungo uku uwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">nu imɛkngo isi ímaangge.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Amb 102.25-27</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyikisong Unum aka agɔr ngge agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">&lt;&lt;Usei nu ubok ughamum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">utsɛku umum iki itsu anggamtsakngo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">awe ubin uku utsorhe andaidakngo?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Amb 110.1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Bɔr ípfu itser-Num kishoo akpurha awu awɛ itser Unum aka adene ngge iyike abirabɛ aka igha ukam ififɔrh.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Igbiir ato ri ingwɛ̃ amɛnmɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Ri itsi akɛrɛ ha awu ufang umɛn ingwɛ̃dzɛn ni ingwɛ̃ amɛnmɛn ra abinkɛ umɛn iki igũ, utsur abin akɔɔ atsu umɛn iyapumɛn. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Isarheyɛ umbɔ aka adzaa umɛn ra angwĩ ípfu itser-Num idɛ̃ɛ̃ ikerngge, nu ubɛn uwuku uzharhuwe ngge use asi idɔsunga ngge, akpo ufaikpi uku umɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Ngge iba iwe rimi, umɛn ikorhi iguse ni ishɔɔr umɛn ĩba isi ingwɛ̃mɛn amɛnmɛn ru nggaa ififɔrh ha umɛn iki igũ? Ififɔrh iyɛrɛ, Uteijee nibikanga agbaashia adũwã ngge, abirabɛ aka agũ ngge agɔr umɛn agɛ iwu idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Unum ikɛi atomuwe ngge ideka ra atsar nu abin igbigba nu idzeu nu ízũwã iyi Ipfu Isarsatangge unga aka agasha ru nyaka unga aka abee.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu awu udzumu uner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Upfung ukpuku uba, ukpurukpi umɛn iki irherhe ri itsi ukpɔ, Unum asi ítsu ípfu itser-Num agha iyɛrhakpɔ. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Bɔr anang akɔɔ aweke uner uwɔɔ aka adzowe ideka ri itsɛng Arherhu-Num agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">&lt;&lt;Anera awu use ungo uku utsu umbɔ ri ifɛrhkɔngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">awɛkaci anera awu use ungo uku udzɛu umbɔ rimi?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Ungo utsu umbɔ awe abirabɛ ípfu itser-Num inangngge umbɔ ri ivanga ukunjiir.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">Ungo ukare umbɔ ikpikpoi nu imor,<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>nu utsuke ubɛn ubin ra andaidakmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Amb 8.4-6</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Ivangyɛ Unum aka itsuke abina kishoo ra andaidakmbɔ, unga asi ínekuka ubin ukpɔɔ uku usi iwekpɔ ri ijeembɔ. Bɔr icɛrɛ umɛn isi inyãmɛn ubɛn ubin uwekpɔ ri ijeembɔ. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Bɔr umɛn inyãmɛn Uyesu uwuruwi umbɔ aka atsu ípfu itser-Num inangngge unga ri ivanga ukunjiir. Icɛrɛ umbɔ aka akare unga ikpikpoi nu imor ubinkutsu unga ahwa uver akpe, ngge itsú unga ru ubok imimutu Unum unga akpe ri iyike ubɛn unera.<verse eid="HEB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Unum unga amuna abina kishoo, abina kishoo awu akinga. Imɛ̃ɛ̃ngge unga akũ anera arhɛrhɛ aba ru umbɔ agasha ri ikpikpoinga. Unga akorha akɛrɛ ri itsu Uyesu awe undzumunga ri ihwa ayetnum na adarh umbɔ azĩ ri ififɔrh.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Uwuku utsu anera awu asarsatambɔ nggu abirabɛ aka atsu umbɔ asar, Utɛmbɔ awu unying. Nggee Uyesu asi igũa atsa iyisa umbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbi awu angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Unga agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">&lt;&lt;Umum iwuri idũwũ itsokngo ra angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">ra asu ikikɔng anerngo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">umum iwuri itsũ ubom ukpuku ukpoi ungo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Amb 22.22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Na agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">&lt;&lt;Umum iwuri itsu imangmangmum ru unga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:17">Uish 8.17</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Ikɛi unga agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">&lt;&lt;Umum uwi nggu anerabɛ Unum aka adzaa umum.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:18">Uish 8.18</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Iki iwe ugɛ abi ha awe ru ijuɛ nggu adzirh, unga awe ubina unying nggu umbɔ ri iyor, ngge itsú unga ru ubok akpenga, awuri atsĩme Undenggũ, uwuruwi aka akpɔm ijee akpe. <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>Na awuri ifɔnuka abirabɛ iwei akpe iki itsu umbɔ igãrhã ru kishoo ibibɛkmbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Awu idzidzɛrhe ugɛ unga asi ibanga iyike ípfu itser-Num, bɔr ayike anang Uibrahim. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Ngge itsu awu ufang unga awe ru nyaka angwɛ̃mbɔ nu anapumbɔ ra atsĩndĩã kishoo, ngge itsú unga awu Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num uwuku utɔ̃itser Unum nggu idzidzɛrhe nu atorh, na awe idɛm iyiki itsũwe arhim anera. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Unga imɛ̃ɛ̃ iyike kishoo abirabɛ umbɔ aka avira umbɔ, ubinkutsu unga nibikanga ahwaa ayetnum ri ivang iviviranga.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu ananga Umusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Nggee, asarkasar angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, abirabɛ umɛn iki iwu awɛrhɛ ru ubok iyiyisa iyi Unum, àka atsu ifɛrhkɔmbi ru Uyesu, uwuruwi umɛn iki ĩdekuwe ugɛ unga awu nggaa uner itser Unum na awu Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Unga akorhunga kishoo abinkɛ uwuku usɛng unga aka abee unga akorhe, ru nyaku Umusa aka akorhe abinkɛ aka amɛ̃ɛ̃ unga akorhe ri iyike abi Unum. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Uyesu amɛ̃ɛ̃ ikpo nggaa imor ananga Umusa, ru nyaku uner uwuku udzin iya aka awe ru imor ananga iya ha. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Ubɛn iya awu unera adzin ike, bɔr Unum unga adzin ubɛn ubin. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Umusa akorhe abinkɛ aka amɛ̃ɛ̃ ugãrhã akorhe ri iyike abi Unum, ri adzowe ideka ra abinkɛ Unum aka irherhe unuma. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Bɔr Ukiristo ani ikorhe ubɛn ubinkpi uku umɛ̃ɛ̃ Ungwɛ̃ akorhe ra abi Unum kishoo. Nu umɛn iwe abi Unum, umɛn ĩba ikpɔmɛn ubinkpi umɛn iki ifosa nggu ikeramɛn nu isheri iwei.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igbiite ato abika asheri imangmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Nggee, Ipfu Isarsatangge igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">&lt;&lt;Irherɛ, umbi aba agũmbi urhɛm Unum,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>àka niba awembi abi ikertsi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">ru nyaka atokambi aka akorhe ri ivang isoyi amɛn hã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">ri ivang iviviri ra arhum.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Nggɔɔ ha atokambi aka avira umum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">imɛka isɔka inaa, umbɔ anyãmbɔ ubinkpi umum iki ikorhe.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Ngge itsu umum igũ avɔm nggu udan ukpɔrɔ ha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">umum igɔr igɛ, &lt;Ubɛn ivang amɛnmbɔ ani iyapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">na asi ihwɛngmbɔ atsĩndĩmum.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Nggee umum itsu ra avɔmmum iyirh ĩgɛ, &lt;Umbɔ asi ítsĩmbɔ ri iwiwoshamum.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Amb 95.7-11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Àka angwɛ̃dzɛn, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, utsur unera ru umbi awe ra amɛn aka abewe akika isheri imangmang atsu unga adzipu undzingnga ru Unum uwu urhɛ. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Bɔr àka afituwe adɔka ubɛn unum, ubɛn unumkpi umbɔ iki iyisa &lt;&lt;Irherɛ,&gt;&gt; ngge itsú unying ru umbi asi íwea uner ikertsi ri itsi irhirhɛm iyi arhim. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Umɛn iwu awɛrha nggu Ukiristo umɛn ĩba ikpɔmmɛn imangmangmɛn iyi inggbaashia izĩ itsĩmɛn imimasha. <verse eid="HEB 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Ru nyaka ngge iki igɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">&lt;&lt;Irherɛ, umbi aba agũmbi urhɛm Unum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">àka niba awembi abi ikertsi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">ru nyaka atokambi aka akorhe ri ivang isoyi amɛn hã.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Amb 95.7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Awu umbɔ ungamɔ agũ urhɛm Unum na asoyi amɛn? Asi iwea umbɔ ha kishoo Umusa aka akũna umbɔ adzek ra abĩ Umasar? <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Awu nggu umbɔ ungamɔ unga aka agũ avɔm imɛka isɔka inaa? Asi iwea nggu abika akorha arhim, ayormbɔ aka akpe ra arhum? <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Awu umbɔ ungamɔ Unum aka ayirh uyirh ugɛ umbɔ asi ítsĩmbɔ ri iwiwoshanga? Asi iwea umbɔ abika akpɛ̃ ididɔsa? <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Nggee umɛn inyãmɛn umbɔ asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ atsĩmbɔ, ubinkutsu ida imangmangmbɔ itsu.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ivang iwiwosha aner Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Nggee, ngge iki iwe ugɛ ibibemuwe ivang iwiwosha iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ngge iba itsĩ icɛrɛ, umɛn ingwɛ̃dzɛn utsur uwɔɔ ru umbi asi ikpoa itsitsĩ ru ngge. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Umɛn iki ĩgũmɛn Isarhe Iyiki Ize umbɔ aka adzaa umɛn, ru nyaka umbɔ aka agũ, bɔr isarhe ha umbɔ aka agũ ishingge ru ugarh ru umbɔ, ubinkutsu, umbɔ asi iyɛimbɔ ngge nggu imangmang ru nyaka abika adɔsa. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Umɛn iki iwe ru imangmang umɛn itsĩ iwiwosha ha, ru nyaku Unum aka agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;&lt;Nggee umum iki itsu ngge nu uyirh nggu avɔmmum ĩgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;Umbɔ asi ítsĩmbɔ ri iwiwoshamum.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Amb 95.11</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ unga amaa itsernga udzur ri ivangyɛ unga aka amunu upfunga. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num irherha arherhe ri itsi unuma utɔɔva igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ru unum ukpu utɔɔva Unum aka awosha ri itsernga kishoo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Ing 2.2</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Bɔr ru ubvur ha Unum arherhe agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umbɔ asi ítsĩmbɔ anang iwiwoshamum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Inang iwengge ugɛ abɔɔ awuri itsĩmbɔ iwiwosha ha, bɔr abirabɛ aka agbaashia agũ Isarhe Iyiki Ize ha asi itsĩmbɔ, ubinkutsu, ida idɔsumbɔ itsu. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Nggee Unum ikɛi abvui atsu unum ukpɔɔ, ayisa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Irherɛ.&gt;&gt; Unga arherha akɛrɛ ra angwĩ Udauda ri ivangyɛ imɛka irhɛirhɛ iki itɔng, agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">&lt;&lt;Irherɛ umbi aba agũmbi urhɛmmum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">àka niba awembi abi ikertsi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Amb 95.7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Ujoshuwa asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ adzowuka umbɔ iwiwosha, ngge itsu Unum arherha arherhe ri itsi unum ukpɔɔ uku iba. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Nggee, unum ukpuku uwosha ra aner Unum una uwe umɔ ru nyaku Unum aka awosha ru unum ukpu utɔɔva. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Ubɛn unerwi aka atsĩ ri iwiwoshu Unum unga akpowe itsinga iwiwosha ri itsernga, ru nyaku Unum aka akorhe ri iyinga. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Nggee, awu ufang umɛn ikorhu ubɛn ubinkpi umɛn iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ ikorhe ri ikpo itsĩ ri iwiwosha ha, ngge itsú anera niba atsĩmmbɔ ri itsi ida ididɔsa ru nyaka abi Uisrairha aka akorhe.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Ubɛn arherhakɛ Unum aka arherhe, aweke ru urhɛ nu iker. Agha anangke ubɛn ikon ikider iyi angwĩã avaa. Ngge idɛ̃ɛ̃ izharhe igashuwe ipfu nu urhɛ, ikɛi agau icim nggu apfupfu. Adɛ̃ɛ̃ ahwɛngke ubɛn ifɛrhkɔ nu amɛn anera. <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Ubin ushikpɔ ra abinkɛ aka amuna kishoo aka awɔk ru Unum. Abina kishoo awu ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asunga. Awu ufang umɛn iki ivarhuwe unga abinkɛ umɛn iki ikorhe kishoo.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe <optbreak/> Idɛm-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Iki iwe ugɛ umɛn iwemɛn ru ukugɔnga ra Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num aka atsĩã ra afã, Uyesu Ungwɛ̃ Unum, nggee umɛn ikpɔm imangmangmɛn iker. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Umɛn isi iwemɛn ru Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num aka asi igũa atorh ru ida ikermɛn, bɔr umɛn iwemɛn ru uwɔɔ uwuruwi umbɔ aka avira unga ra atsĩndĩã kishoo, ru nyaka umbɔ aka avira umɛn, bɔr unga ashia ra arhim. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Nggee umɛn ĩba nggu ikeramɛn ru Unum uwuruwi aka awe ru inna, ngge itsú umɛn iyɛi atorh nu umata ukpuku uyika umɛn ri ivang iyiki ibibee.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Aka isaka asɛng ubɛn Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num ra akatsak na atsu unga awe asumbɔ ri itser-Num, unga awuri iyɛruwe izũwã nu idzowe idɛm-Num ri itsi arhim. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Unga idɛ̃ɛ̃ angwɛ̃dzɛn nggu abika asheri ihwihwɛng abika ayapa, ubinkutsu unga awea ru ida iker iganga. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu awu ufang unga adzowe idɛm-Num ra arhimnga, nu arhim anera ikɛi.<verse eid="HEB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ asɛnga itsinga ri imor iyɛrɛ, bɔr awu Unum ukpekũ awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ asɛng unga, ru nyaka unga aka asɛng Uharuna. <verse eid="HEB 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Rimi hã ikɛi Ukiristo asi ibeeka itsinga ikpikpoi iyiki iwe Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num. Bɔr awu Unum agɔr unga agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">&lt;&lt;Ungo uwu ungwɛ̃mum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">irherɛ umum iwu Utɛngo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Amb 2.7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Unga abvui arherhe ra anang akɔɔ agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">&lt;&lt;Ungo uwu uner uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num uwu ugbagbaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">ri itɔ̃ itser iyi Unum ru nyaku Umarhkizadak.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Amb 110.4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Ri ivang Uyesu aka awe ri iyor ru upfung, unga afɛn-Num nggu iciu akpe atsotsorake nu anyĩ, afɛn uwuruwi aka amɛ̃ɛ̃ ifɔrhe unga ra akpe, agũmbɔ unga ubinkutsu unga awu uner uwuku udɔsu Unum na adzowe unga imor. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Unga awu Ungwɛ̃ Unum, bɔr unga amesi ididɔsa ru utsĩndĩ ayetnumkɛ unga aka ahwa, <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>unga aka amaa ihwa ayetnumnga kishoo, umbɔ atsu unga awe utsĩndĩ ififɔrh iyi ugbagbaa ru kishoo abika adɔsa unga. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Unum atsu unga awe Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num ri itɔ̃ itser iyi Unum ru nyaku Umarhkizadak.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igbiir ato ri idzipu undzing <optbreak/> ri imangmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Umɛn iwe ra abin arhɛrhɛ umɛn iki irherhe ra akɛrɛ ha, bɔr aghong umɛn iki idɛyiwa umbi agbena, ubinkutsu, umbi asi ifɛ̃rhũmbi idzursu. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Icɛrɛ imɛ̃ngge umbi awe abika umumesuwe, bɔr utsɛku icɛrɛ umbi abee unera abvui amesuwa umbi angwɛ̃rhã abina akɔɔ ra Arherhu-Num. Umbi abee abɛ̃, ubinkutsu, umbi asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ aghambi ubingha akakũ! <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Ubɛn uwuruwi abɛ̃ aka awe ubinghanga awu irheng ungwɛ̃, asi ihwɛnga imesa iyiki irhika. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Bɔr ubingha akakũ uwu ukerketakpɔ. Akakũ hã adɛ̃ɛ̃ asɛngmbɔ iyiki ize ri iyiki ibewe, ubinkutsu umbɔ ubɛn unum ani ikũ ihwihwɛngmbɔ iyiki irhika.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Nggee, umɛn itsu amɛnmɛn ri iwe akakũ, asi iwea irherha arherhe ri itsi abinkɛ umɛn iki imesa ri itsi Ukiristo ri inggbaashia ukpekũ, akirakɛ aka awu atar idzin aki imangmangmɛn. Ake awu idzidzipa ri ifɛre iki ikũ umɛn izĩ ra akpe ni iwe ru imangmang ru Unum, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>arherhi imesa iyi ubɔtisima, nu itsorhuwe abok, nu isisok ra akpe, nu itsu uvau iyi ugbagbaa. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Imɛ̃ɛ̃ngge umɛn iwe akakũ, Unum aba abemunga.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Abirabɛ aka anyãmbɔ irhirhang iyi idzidzɛrhe Unum na aka abanga agũmbɔ izũwãnga, abirabɛ aka akpombɔ iwu awɛrhu uzãrhã Ipfu Isarsatangge, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>na aka abangumbɔ ize Arherhu-Num nu ijee ivangyɛ uku iba unuma, <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>na abvui adzipu undzingmbɔ ru Unum, isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ iwengge ugɛ umbɔ abvui akũ umbɔ adzipa aba ru Unum. Akɛrɛ awu idzidzɛrhe, ubinkutsu iwu ugɛɛ umbɔ aka abvui anyapuwe Ungwɛ̃ Unum na adzowe unga atsa ra awiya.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Abĩkɛ aki ihwa inai ubɛn unum ngge idoi nu ake aka isaka amɛrke abin aka awe ru ugarh ra abirabɛ iki ikau ake, abĩ hã rakɔ iki iyɛi idorh Unum. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Bɔr abĩ aka amɛr ididɔk nu undzi, ashike ru ugarh nukpɔ. Abĩ hã Unum aka ayoka itsu ake ikponum. Ri imimaa ikɛi awuri ikpĩĩwe ake.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Umbi awɛrhamɛn umɛn iki ĩbema akarhãrhã, umɛn irherhumɛn rimi hã, bɔr umɛn iwemɛn ri ikeramɛn ugɛ umbi awe ru udĩ uku uze, udĩ hã uwu ukpu ififɔrh. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Unum asi iwea ri ida irhirhika, unga asi íyiruka itsermbi nu ibibemayɛ umbi aka adɛyiwe unga ri iyiyikeyɛ umbi aka akorhuwe abika adɔsa, ru nyaka umbi aki ikorhe. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Umɛn ibee ubɛn unera ru umbi atsu asunga ri idɛyiwe ikikorhe ha azĩ atsĩ imimasha, ngge itsú umbi akpo ubinkpi umbi aka afosa. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Umɛn isi ibeemɛn umbi awe ru ighɛrha, bɔr àka akorhe ru nyaka abirabɛ aka iyɛi ubinkpi Unum aka abemuwe ru ubok imangmang nu ibibimambɔ.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itsuifɛr ibibemuwe-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Ivangyɛ Unum aka abemuwe Uibrahim, uwɔɔ aka ananga Unum ashia, nggee unga ayirh nggu itsinga, <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu idzidzɛrhe umum iwuri itsuka ungo idorh, umum iwuri itsu unangngo uwe urhɛrhɛ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Ing 22.17</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Mɔcɛ Uibrahim aka abima adzɛu, ayɛisa ubinkpi Unum aka abemuwe unga.<verse eid="HEB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Anera aka isaka ayirh ri itsok unerwi aka ananga umbɔ, uyirh ha udɛyiwe ugɛ arherhanga awu idzidzɛrhe na akɛnke ubɛn uning. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Unum abee idɛyiwe ukupɛ̃ɛ̃ ra abirabɛ aka awe abi ukam ra abinkɛ unga aka abemuwe ugɛ abinkɛ unga aka abee ikorhe asi ífaruke. Nggee unga atsuafɛr nggu uyirh. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Ibibemuwe nu uyirh ha asi ífaruke, ubinkutsu, Unum asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ agbɛrangwĩ. Unum atsu ibibemuwe nu uyirh ha ngge itsú umɛn abirabɛ iki itĩ izĩ ru unga akaa umɛn, umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ ikpɔmmɛn ifosayɛ umbɔ aka atsu ra asumɛn na adzaa umɛn ififita akarhãrhã. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Umɛn iwe ru ifosa iyɛrɛ ngge iwe ubinkpi uku ukpɔm urhɛmɛn, ake ashike ni iwei nggu icicang. Ake anu itsĩrhã ru unɔrkang andzing urhaburhe anangkɛ aka asar anangke ananga kishoo, <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>anangkɛ Uyesu aka agbaashia azĩ ri itsimɛn. Unga awu Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num uwu ugbagbaa ri itɔ̃ itser iyi Unum ru nyaka Umarhkizadak.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Umarhkizadak uwuku udzowe <optbreak/> idɛm-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Umarhkizadak ha awu uyɛrhu Usarhim na awu uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num uwu Unum Uwuku Ugɔnga. Agbopu Uibrahim aka adzeki iwayɛ unga aka atang nggu ayɛrhe arhɛrhɛ agha inggbaashi, Umarhkizadak atsuke unga idorh. <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Uibrahim adzowe unga unying ra abina usɔka ru ubɛn abinnga. Agben Umarhkizadak awu, &lt;&lt;Uyɛrhe irhirhika.&gt;&gt; Ikɛi unga awu Uyɛrhe Usarhim, agbena awu, &lt;&lt;Uyɛrhe ididɔɔr.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Asi idɛyiwambɔ umɛn ubin ri itsi utɛ Umarhkizadak use uyanga use atokanga. Asi idɛyiwambɔ umɛn unum imarnga use unum akpenga. Unga awu uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num uwu ugbagbaa ru nyaku Ungwɛ̃ Unum.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Àka arhi anyã ikpũ imornga. Uko Uibrahim utokamɛn adzowuka unga unying ra abinnga usɔka ra abinkɛ unga aka akpo ri iwa! <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Ri Íkpem awu ufang abi Urhawi aka awe abika adzowe idɛm-Num ayɛi ubina unying ra abina usɔka ra abin aner Uisrairha aka awe, nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ umbɔ awu unang Uibrahim. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Umarhkizadak aka asi iwea unang Urhawi, bɔr unga ayɛisa ugau unying ra abina usɔka ru Uibrahim, na atsukuka idorh ru Uibrahim uwuku uwe ru ibibemuwe iyi Unum. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Icicang ishingge uwuku utsuke idorh ananga uwuku uyɛi idorh. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Ru utsĩndĩ uwɔɔ, abi Urhawi abirabɛ aka ikpe ayɛimbɔ ugau unying ra abina usɔka, bɔr ru utsĩndĩ uwɔɔ, Umarhkizadak uwuruwi umbɔ aka agɔr agɛ unga awe nggu urhɛ ayɛi. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Urhawi nibikanga ani iyɛi ubina unying ra abina usɔka ha, bɔr adɛ̃ɛ̃ agɔrmbɔ agɛ unga aka afasa ubin ukpunga ru ubok Uibrahim ivangyɛ Uibrahim aka adzowe unying ra abina usɔka ru Umarhkizadak. <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>Urhawi ana awu ri iyor Uibrahim ri ivangyɛ Uibrahim aka adzowe unying ra abina usɔka ru Umarhkizadak.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu awu ru nyaku Umarhkizadak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Idzidzɛrhe, umbɔ aka adzowe anera Ikpem hã, adzowe umbɔ nggu ikpem itser iyiki idzowe idɛm-Num Urhawi nu unangnga aka akorhe. Anera aba adɛ̃ɛ̃ awembɔ abika arhika ru ubok idzowe idɛm-Num urhawi nu unangnga aka akorhe, awu use utsu umbɔ abee uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num uwɔɔ aka iba, uwuruwi aka awu uner uwuku utɔ̃itser iyi Unum ru nyaka Umarhkizadak, isi iwengge ru nyaku Uharuna? <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka afaruwe ikpũ idzowe idɛm-Num, awu ufang umbɔ afaruwe Íkpema. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Uyesu uwuruwi umbɔ aka arherhe abin hã ri itsinga, asi iwea unang Urhawi, unera unying ra atokanga anasi iwea uner uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Iwu idzidzɛrhe Uteijeemɛn adzeku unang Uyahuda, abirabɛ Umusa aka asi irherhunga ugɛ umbɔ awe abika adzowe idɛm-Num.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Umbɔ awuri igbisha ahwɛngmbɔ ubinkpi umɛn iki irherhe uba uwɔɔ uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num ru nyaku Umarhkizadak adzekanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Asi isɛngmbɔ uner ha ri itsi ikpem atokanga, bɔr iwe ri itsi urhɛnga uku usi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ umaamgbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Ubinkutsu umbɔ adzowe ideka ri itsinga ra Arherhu-Num ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">&lt;&lt;Ungo uwu uner uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num uwu ugbagbaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">ri itɔ̃ itser iyi Unum ru nyaka Umarhkizadak.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Amb 110.4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Angwɛ̃we ikpem iyi isha ri ibanga ubinkutsu ngge ishingge ri ijee nu ugarh, <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>ubinkutsu Íkpem isi itsu anera arhikumbɔ. Bɔr ifosa iyiki izea iki idzekangge, ru ubokngge umɛn iki ĩba ikhapa ru Unum.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Unum atsu ngge nggu uyirh! Abika adzowe idɛm-Num abɔɔ asi itsĩmbɔ itser nggu uyirh. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Bɔr unga awu uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num nggu uyirh ri ivangyɛ Unum aka agɔr unga agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">&lt;&lt;Uteijee aka ayirha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">asi ífarunga amɛnnga agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">&lt;Ungo uwu uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num ugbagbaa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Amb 110.4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Uyirh ha udɛyiwe ugɛ Uyesu awuri itsu ibibemuwe-Num iyiki izea iwe.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Abika adzowe idɛm-Num hã awu arhɛrhɛ, ubinkutsu akpe aka isaka akɛn umbɔ itsermbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Bɔr Uyesu awu uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num ugbagbaa, ubinkutsu unga awe ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Nggee icɛrɛ nu ugbagbaa unga imɛ̃ɛ̃ ifɔrhe kishoo abirabɛ aka aba akhapa ru Unum ru ubok unga, ubinkutsu unga abɛk ugbagbaa na afɛne-Num ru umbɔ.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Ikpũ Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num uwɛrɛ ha umɛn iki ibee, unga awu asarsatawɔ, ashia ru uvau, aka atsũwũkumbɔ unga ra anang abi arhim na akũ unga azĩmbɔ ra anang ikpikpoi akagɔnga ra afã. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Unga asi iwea ru nyaka Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num abɔɔ, abirabɛ aki idzowe idɛm-Num inuma ni inuma, agbaashia adzowe idɛm-Num iyi arhimmbɔ, mɔcɛ na adzowe iyi arhim anera. Bɔr Uyesu adzowe itsinga awe idɛm-Num ru arhim anera idiki unying ugbagbaa ri ivangyɛ unga aka adzowe itsinga akpe. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Anera kishoo ani ikorha arhim na akpe. Íkpem Umusa ini isɛng Akagɔng Abika Adzowe Idɛm-Num ra aner ha, bɔr uyirh ha uku uba ru undzing Íkpem, usɛng Ungwɛ̃wi umbɔ aka atsu unga awu undzumu Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num uwu ugbagbaa.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num <optbreak/> uwu ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Itsi arherhamɛn ru ubinkpi umɛn iki irherhe unggakpi, umɛn iwemɛn ru Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num, aka asei nu ubok ugha anang isei Uwuku Ugɔnga ra afã. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Unga hã ikɛi ani itɔ̃ itser ri Iya-Num, utsurha idzidzɛrhe uwu Unum, akirakɛ Uteijee unga adzin, asi iwea abok anera.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Ubɛn Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num asɛng unga idzowe izũwã nu idɛm-Num, nggee awu ufang Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Nummɛn hã ikɛi awe ru ubinkpi unga aka idzowe. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Unga aba awe ru upfung, unga asi íwea uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num, ubinkutsu ishaisha umbɔ atsu abɔɔ awe abika adzowe ízũwã ri igigɔr Íkpem Umusa. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Atɔ̃ itser ri Iya-Num, ikirikɛ iki iwu uzirhzĩ anangkɛ aka awe ra afã. Akɛrɛ ha atsu umbɔ avange Umusa ri ivangyɛ unga aka awuri itar utsurha Unum. Umbɔ agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ukorhu ubɛn ubina uwe ru nyaka umbɔ aka adɛyiwa ungo ni igũ hã.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Idzi 25.40</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Bɔr itseryɛ Uyesu aka ayɛi inangge iyi abika adzowe idɛm-Num ru nyaki ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa ha unga aka atsu ngge iwe, inangge iyiki agbe ha, ubinkutsu ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa ha ikũwa umɛn abin aka azea.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Agɛ ibibemuwe-Num iyi inggbaashia isi igbangge, umbɔ asi íbeembɔ iyɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Bɔr Unum anyã igbigba ra anera na agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">&lt;&lt;Uteijee unga agɔr agɛ, ivanga niyɔ ibarɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">umum iwuri ĩbemuwe abi iya Uisrairha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">nu iya Uyahuda ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Isi íwengge ru nyaki ibibemuwe iyiriyɛ umum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">iki ĩbemuwe nggu atokambɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">ri ivangyɛ umum iki ikpɔm ubokmbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ikũna umbɔ ĩdzek ra abĩ Umasar.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Umbɔ asi ikorhumbɔ ubinkpi umum iki ibee ri iyɛi ibibemuwemum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ngge itsu umum ĩdzipu undzingmum ru umbɔ,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="HEB 8:9">Uteijee unga agɔr.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Iyɛrɛ iwu ibibemuweyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">umum iki ĩbemuwe aner Uisrairha ivang iyi ha iba itɔ̃ngge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Uteijee unga agɔr.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Umum iwuri itsuke Íkpemmum ra amɛnmbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ikɛi umum iwuri itsɛnge ngge ra amɛnmbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Umum iwuri iwu Unummbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">umbɔ awu anermum.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Asi ímesukumbɔ adɔkambɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">use uwɔɔ agɔr ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">&lt;Uhwɛng Uteijee,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">ubinkutsu kishoo awuri ihwɛngmbɔ umum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">udzur ra abika awe ru ugarh ukunjiir uba utsĩ abika awe ru ugarh urhɛrhɛ.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Umum iwuri itsũwũkũ iyiki ibewambɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">ni isi íbvui iyitumum arhimmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Uiri 31.31-34</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Ivangyɛ unga aka arherha arherhe ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa ha, unga aka atsu iyi inggbaashia iwe iyiki igbe, ikɛi ubɛn ubin ukpuku ugbe uku ukɔ̃kpɔ usi ídãrhũkpɔ nu ugwir.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Idzowe igɔng ru Utsurha-Num <optbreak/> uwu upfung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Ibibemuwe-Num iyi inggbaashia iwengge ra atsĩndĩkɛ aka awu ufang ru umbɔ adɔsa ri idzowe igɔng ru Unum nu ikɛi ra anangkɛ aki ikorha ake ru upfung. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Atar utsurha Unum. Anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhang nu utebur iyi uborodi ukpuku unɛmuwe ru Unum awu ru udãwunga. Anang akɛrɛ ha umbɔ ayisa ake Anang Akika Asar. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Ru undzing urhaburhe umbɔ aka ayapuwe ru untana uba utai ra abĩ awu ubã ukpɔɔ umbɔ ayisa ake Anangkɛ Aka Asar Anangke Ananga Kishoo. <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Ubã hã uwekpɔ ru ubeu uzinarhi umbɔ iki ikpĩĩ isung umɔ, nu ikɛi akɔti ibibemuwe-Num umbɔ aka afuruwe ake nggu uzinarhi. Akɔti ha awe nggu igbong Uharuna iyiki ipfum ayerhe nu abata atarh avaa aka awe ru Íkpema usɔka Unum aka adzowe ru Umusa nu undzoma uzinarhi ukucii uku uwe ru umanna. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Ímimuna iyiki iwe ra afɛ, iyiriyɛ irhirhang Unum iki icipuwa ru ake, adɛ̃ɛ̃ ni itsi akɔti ha na adzowe uzirhzĩ ru utsĩmwi umbɔ aki itsũwe arhim. Bɔr icɛrɛ umɛn isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ irherhumɛn arherhe ri itsi abin hã unying anying. <figure style="fig" alt="Ark of the Covenant with Priest" file="cn02092b.tif" size="col" loc="9.5" copy="David C. Cook" ref="9.5">Akɔti ibibemuwe nggu uner uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num</figure><verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Umbɔ aka amaa igbisha abin hã rimi, abika adzowe idɛm-Num atsĩrhã ru udãwã hã atɔ̃ itsermbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Bɔr Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num ukpekũ awuri itsĩ ru unɔrkãn uwu uvaa, idiki unying ra amɛka. Unga awuri itsĩ nggu adzirh, unga aka iyɛruwe ru arhimnga nu arhim anera aka akorhe ri ida ihwihwɛng. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Ru ubok abin hã kishoo Ipfu Isarsatangge idɛyiwa igɛ umbɔ asi ihwɛngmbɔ utsĩndĩ uwuku utsĩ Anankɛ Aka Asar Anangke Ananga Kishoo, akirakɛ aka awu ra afã, ri ivangyɛ utsurha Unum uwu inggbaashia aka ana adɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Akɛrɛ ake adɛyiwa umɛn abin ri itsi ivang iyɛrɛ. Ake adɛyiwa umɛn ugɛ ízũwã nu idɛm-Num umbɔ iki iyɛruwe isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ itsungge amɛn abika adzowe igɔng aweke uku urhirhiki. <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Akɛrɛ ha awu arherhe ighigha nu ihwihwa nu ikpũ isisorh nggu amɛ̃, awu agbeyi utsɛku unumkpi Unum aka itsu ake awe aka afa.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adzirh Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Bɔr ivangyɛ Ukiristo aka aba ugɛɛ Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num uwu abin aka aze umbi aka ayɛi, unga atsĩ ru utsurha uwuku uzea uwu Unum, uwuku uwe ru imor unangmgbɔ uwu upfunga, uwuruwi asi iwea unera atar, asi iwea ikpũ imimuna iyɛrɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Asi itsĩa nggu adzirh ishur use aki inak. Bɔr unga atsĩ ra Anankɛ Aka Asar Anangke Ananga Kishoo nggu adzirhnga. Unga akorha akɛrɛ ha idiki unying ugbagbaa akpowa umɛn ififɔrh iyi ugbagbaa. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Adzirh ishur nu aki inak iyiki itsak nu atɔɔ ungwɛ̃ inak umbɔ aka isaka akũ amisuwe ra anerabɛ aka asi itɛnmbɔ ngge itsú umbɔ awe abika atɛn ra asu Unum. <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Adzirh Ukiristo awuri ikorhe anangke aki ha akarhãrhã! Unga uwuruwi ru ubok Ipfu-Num iyi ugbagbaa adzowe itsinga uwuku usheru uvau ru Unum. Adzirhnga adɛ̃ɛ̃ asorhke arhimmɛn akirakɛ aki ikũna umɛn azĩ ra akpe na atsu amɛnmɛn arhika, ngge itsú umɛn ima itɔ̃ itser Unum uwu urhɛ.<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Akɛrɛ ha atsu Ukiristo awe uwuruwi aka atsu ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa iwe, ngge itsú abirabɛ umbɔ aka ayisa ama ayɛi ukam ukpu ugbagbaa ukpurukpi umbɔ aka abemuwe. Akɛrɛ adɛ̃ɛ̃ aweke, ubinkutsu unga aka akpe akpekɛ aka ifɔrhe anera ra arhimkɛ umbɔ aka akorhe ri izharhuwe ibibemuwe-Num iyi inggbaashia.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Unera aba abemuka awɛkacinga ukamnga, awu ufang umbɔ adzɛu unga akpe kata nu umbɔ adɔrha ayɛi, <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>ubinkutsu, ibibemuwe iyi ukam isi íwengge utsɛku uner ha aka ikpe. Ibibemuwe ukam ha isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ iwengge uba uner uku ubemuwe ha ana awu nggu urhɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Ngge itsu umbɔ akũ adzirh atsu ibibemuwe-Num iyi inggbaashia itɔ̃ itser. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Ivangyɛ Umusa aka amaa isɔme ubɛn Íkpem ra anera ha kishoo, unga anyangu adzirh íbũ nu angwɛ̃ inak, atoma nggu amɛ̃ na anyangu ayerhe umbɔ iki iyisa uizob nggu igwar idɔi umbɔ aka atsu ngge iwu iyiki ibãrhã akũ amisa adzirh ha ru ubvur Íkpem hã nu atsi anera. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛrɛ ake awu adzirh ibibemuwe-Num, ibibemuwe iyiriyɛ Unum aka adɛyiwa umbi adɔsa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Idzi 24.8</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Rimi hã ikɛi, unga amisuwe adzirh ri itsi Utsurha-Num hã nu kishoo abinkɛ umbɔ iki ikũ akpoi Unum. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Idzidzɛrhe, ri Íkpem Umusa, abina ukunjiir umbɔ aka asi ikũ adzirh atsu ake asar. Asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsũwũkumbɔ arhim, adzirh aba asi igbake. <figure style="fig" alt="They tie hair of sheep with Hyssop dip in blood" file="hk00114b.tif" size="col" loc="9.22" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="9.19">Abow igwar idɔi nu uizob arhɔma ra adzirh</figure><verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Ngge itsu awu ufang abina kishoo ru Utsurha-Num akirakɛ aka awe ru nyaka abin ra afã, umbɔ asorh ake nggu adzirh íjuɛ. Bɔr abin aki afã awu ufang umbɔ asorh ake nggu idɛm iyiki izea iki inangngge iyi adzirh íjuɛ ha. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Ngge itsu Ukiristo asi itsĩa anang akika asar anera aka adzin aka awe usaka uwuruwi uku uwe ra afã. Bɔr unga atsĩ ra afã hã ngge itsú unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu Unum icɛrɛ ri itsimɛn. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Ikɛi unga asi itsĩ ra afã adzowuka itsinga idikunga irhɛirhɛ, ru nyaku Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num aki itsĩ ra Anankɛ Aka Asar Anangke Ananga Kishoo ubɛn amɛka nggu adzirhkɛ aka asi iweke akinga. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Iba iwe rimi, Ukiristo awuri ihwa ayetnum arhɛrhɛ udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amunu upfunga. Bɔr ngge iki iwe, unga akpurha adzeka idiki unying ukpekũ ri imimaa upfunga atsũwe arhim ri idzowe itsinga awe idɛm-Num. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Ru nyaku unera aka awu ufang unga aka ikpe idiki unying, akɛrɛ aba amaa umbɔ awuri avarhuwe arherhenga, <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>rimi hã Ukiristo awu idɛm-Num idiki unying ugbagbaa anyanguwe arhim anera arhɛrhɛ. Unga awuri ibvui adzekanga idevaa, asi íbanga itsũwe arhim, bɔr akũ ififɔrh aba ru abirabɛ aka adzɛu ibibanga.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Ukiristo awu idɛm-Num <optbreak/> idika unying ru kishoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Íkpem Umusa iwu usaka abin aka aze aka iba ukpekũ, isi iwengge undzumu abin hã. Nggee idɛm-Num ri Íkpem hã, iyiriyɛ umbɔ iki ikorhe ubɛn amɛka, isi idɛ̃ɛ̃ itsũwũkũngge arhim abika azĩ akhapa ru Unum. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Uba idɛm-Num imɛ̃ngge itsũwe arhim, abika adzowe idɛm-Num asi ínekukumbɔ idzowe idɛm-Num hã? Ubinkutsu abika adzowe igɔng ru Unum adɛ̃ɛ̃ ikpombɔ isisar idika unying ugbagbaa, na asi ígũmbɔ ighong arhimmbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Bɔr idɛm-Num hã iwu utsĩndĩ uwuku uyituwe arhim ubɛn amɛka. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Ubinkutsu, adzirh ínak nu aki íbũ asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsũwũke arhim.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Nggee ivangyɛ Ukiristo aka atsĩwã ru upfung, unga agɔr Unum agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">&lt;&lt;Ídɛm-Num nu ízũwã ungo usi ibeengo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">bɔr ungo uku udzaango umum iyoryɛ umum iki inɛ̃muwe.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Ídɛm-Num iyiki ikpikpĩĩ nu ídɛm-Num iyiki itsũwe arhim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">ungo usi igũo ibɛn ngge.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Mɔcɛ umum igɔr igɛ, &lt;A Unummum, umum uwi iki ĩba ikorhuwa ungo ubinkpi ungo uku ubee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ru nyaka umbɔ aka atsɛng ru ubvurngo ri itsimum.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Amb 40.6-8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Ri inggbaashia unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ídɛm-Num nu ízũwã nu ídɛm-Num iyiki ikpĩĩ nu ídɛm-Num iyiki itsũwe arhim ungo usi ibeengo, ungo usi igũo ibɛn ngge.&gt;&gt; Bɔr awu Íkpem itsu umbɔ akorha akɛrɛ ha. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Mɔcɛ unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum uwi, umum iki ĩba ikorhuwa ungo ubinkpi ungo uku ubee.&gt;&gt; Unga adene ídɛm-Num hã iyi inggbaashia ri ifɛna ngge itsú unga aden idɛm-Num iyi uvaa. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Ivangyɛ Uyesu Ukiristo aka akorhu ubinkpi Unum aka abee unga akorhe, umbɔ atsu umɛn iwe asasar ru ubok unga aka adzowe itsinga awe idɛm-Num hã idiki unying ugbagbaa.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Ubɛn uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num adɛ̃ɛ̃ itser ubɛn unum adzowe ídɛm-Num idikũnga irhɛirhɛ, bɔr ngge isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ itsũwũkũngge arhim. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Bɔr ivangyɛ Ukiristo aka adzowe idɛm-Num idiki unying ri itsuwe arhim ugbagbaa, unga asei ru ubok ugha Unum. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Udzur ri ivang hã unga anu idzɛu utsɛku umbɔ aki itsu anggamtsaknga awe ubin uku utsorhe andaidaknga. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Idɛm-Num iyi idiki unying hã ngge itsu anera awu asarsatambɔ na awu undzumunga ugbagbaa. <figure style="fig" alt="Priest offering daily sacrifice" file="cn02093b.tif" size="col" loc="10.16" copy="David C. Cook" ref="10.11">Uner uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num adɛ̃ɛ̃ idzowe idɛm-Num ubɛn unum</figure><verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Ipfu Isarsatangge ikɛi idzaangge umɛn ideka ra akɛrɛ ha. Ni inggbaashia igɔr igɛ,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>&lt;&lt;Uteijee agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">ibibemuwe ha iyɛ umum iki ikorhe nggu umbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">inum hã iba imaangge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">umum iwuri itsuke Íkpemmum ri ifɛrhkɔmbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">ikɛi umum iwuri itsɛnge ngge ra amɛnmbɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Uiri 31.33</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Mɔcɛ unga atoma agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">&lt;&lt;Umum isi íbvui iyitumum arhimmbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">nu iki ibewambɔ.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Uiri 31.34</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka atsũwe abin akɛrɛ ha, asi íbvui abeembɔ idɛm-Num iyiki atsũwe arhim.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyisa ukpuku ububima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umɛn iwemɛn ri ikeramɛn iyiki iwe nggu Unum ugɛɛ umɛn iki itsĩ ra Anankɛ Aka Asar Anangke Ananga Kishoo ri ijee adzirh Uyesu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Unga atsuruwa umɛn utsĩndĩ uwuku ufa uku ukũwã umɛn urhɛ. Utsĩndĩ hã uwe ru ubok urhaburhe ha ungo iki itɔng utsĩ ra Anangkɛ Aka Asar Anangke Ananga Kishoo. Urhaburhe ha uwu usaka iyor Uyesu. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Umɛn iki iwemɛn ru nggaa uwuku udzowe idɛm-Num uwuruwi iki idzɛu abi Unum kishoo. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>Nggee, umɛn ĩba ikhapa ru Unum nggu amɛn aki idzidzɛrhe nu imangmang iyiki iker nu amɛnkɛ aka atɛn na ashike ru ifɛrhkɔ iyiki idɛyiwa umɛn igɛ umɛn ikorhe iyiki ibewe nu ayormɛn umbɔ aka asorh nggu amɛ̃ aka atɛn ikɛi. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Umɛn idɛ̃ɛ̃ iker ri ifosayɛ umɛn iki irherhe, ubinkutsu uwu ha aka abemuwa umɛn awu uner idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Umɛn ikaifɛrhkɔ atsĩndĩkɛ umɛn iki ifituwe adɔka umbɔ awe ru ibibema na akorha abin aka aze. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Umɛn niba inekukumɛn ikikɔngmɛn abika adɔsa ru nyaka abɔɔ aka aneke ikikɔng hã, bɔr umɛn itoma ri ifituwe adɔka, ubinkutsu umɛn inyãmɛn unum ibiba Ukiristo uku uyokpɔ. <figure style="fig" alt="The curtain inside the Temple" file="bk00278b.tif" size="col" loc="10.25" copy="Louise Bass, Horace Knowles" ref="10.20">Urhaburhe ri Iya-Num</figure><verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Umɛn iba idzum ikorha abin arhim umɛn iki imaa iyɛi ihwihwɛng idzidzɛrhe, idɛm-Num iyiki itsũwe arhim ibvui ishingge. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>Bɔr umɛn ikpurhi iwe ru iwei itsu uvau nu nggaa urhakpi uku ikpĩĩwe abirabɛ aka akpɛ̃mbɔ Unum. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Ubɛn uwuku ukpɛ̃ɛ̃ Íkpem Umusa, umbɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ afɛrmbɔ unga asi ígũmbɔ atorh uba inera ivaa use itaar adzowukumbɔ ideka ri itsinga. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Uba umbɔ atsu ufai akpe ru unerwi aka akpɛ̃ɛ̃ Ikpem, ri ifɛrhkɔmbi, awuri ikorha aguse ru unerwi aka akwɛɛte Ungwɛ̃ Unum, na anyanga adzirh ibibemuwe-Num ha umbɔ aka akũ asare umɛn awe aka atãrhã, na arhenu Ipfu-Num iyi imimuta? Awuri ikorha anangmbɔ rimi hã. <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Ubinkutsu umɛn ihwɛngmɛn unga uwuku ugɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ififai iwu iyimum, awu umum iwuri ibvui ifase umbɔ iyiki ibeweyɛ umbɔ aka akorhe.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Iva 32.35</ref></char>.</note> Abvui agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uteijee unga awuri itsu uvau anernga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:36">Iva 32.36</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:14">Amb 135.14</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Awu ubin iwei unera agba ra abok Unum uwu urhɛ.<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Àka ayita inum iyi isha umbi aka agbaashia anyã irhirhang Unum amaa, ivangyɛ umbi aka abima atɛ̃wã akarhãrhã nggu ayetnum ru ubok abɔɔ. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Ivang iyɔɔ umbɔ arhena umbi na adzaa umbi uver ra awiya, ivang iyɔɔ umbi agbopa atsimbi nggu abika ahwa ikpũ ayetnum hã. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Umbi agũmbi atorh abirabɛ aka awe ru ugborzĩ na awembi ru itɛnamɛn ivangyɛ umbɔ aka avur abinmbi, ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi agɛ umbi awembi ru ubin ukpuku uze unangkpɔ nu uwe ugbagbaa.<verse eid="HEB 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Nggee àka niba atarkumbi iker amɛnmbi, ngge iwuri idzaa umbi nggaa itosa. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Imɛ̃ngge umbi abima, ngge itsú ri ivangyɛ umbi aka imaa ikorhu ubinkpi Unum aka abee, umbi awuri iyɛimbi ubinkpi unga aka abemuwa umbi.<verse eid="HEB 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ri ivanga ukunjiir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">unga uwuku ububa ha awuri ibibanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">asi ídãrhũnga.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Bɔr unermum uwuku urhika awuri ibɛk ru utsĩndĩ imangmang.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Amɛnmum asi ígũke ibɛn unga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">unga aba agũ iwei abvui azĩa ra andzing.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:3">Uha 2.3</ref>,<ref loc="HAB 2:4">4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Bɔr umɛn isi iwemɛn ikpũ abika agũ iwei na abvui azĩ ra andzing azĩa atsim, bɔr umɛn iwe abika awe ru imangmang na akpo ififɔrh.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Abi imangmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Imangmang iwu ikeramɛn ru ubinkpi umɛn iki ifosa, ihwɛng abinkɛ asu aka anasi inyãke ugɛ awu idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Iwe ru ubok imangmang hã Unum aka ayɛi abi isha. <verse eid="HEB 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Awe ri imangmang umɛn iki ihwɛng ugɛ Unum akũ irhɛm amunu upfunga, ngge itsú abinkɛ umɛn iki inyã, asi imunumbɔ ake ru ubok abinkɛ umbɔ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ anyã.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang Uhabirha aka adzowe Unum idɛm-Num iki izeyɛ iki inangngge iyi Ukayinu. Awe ru ubok imangmang umbɔ aka anyã unga arhiku uner, ivangyɛ Unum aka arherhi iyiki ize ri itsinga ri iyɛi ízũwãnga. Unga aka akpea, bɔr icɛrɛ ru ubok imangmangnga unga ana arherha arherhe.<verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang umbɔ aka ashupu Uenɔk nggu urhɛ ngge itsu unga asi inyãã akpe. Asi inyãmbɔ unga, ubinkutsu, Unum aka ashupa unga azĩa. Anera ahwɛngmbɔ ugɛ Uenɔk atsu Unum agũibɛn, umbɔ adɔrha ashupa unga. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Imangmang iba ishingge, asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ atsu Unum agũa ibɛn, ubinkutsu awu ufang kishoo uwuku uba ukhapa ru Unum awe ru imangmang ugɛ Unum awea, ikɛi unga ani idzowe itosa ru kishoo abika abeea unga.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang, Unuhu aka agbishu ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ ukugɔng ngge itsú unga afɔrh aner iyanga ri itsi abin aka abewe Unum aka adɛyiwe unga agɛ awuri ibake. Unga akorha akɛrɛ ha ubinkutsu unga awea ri iwei Unum akarhãrhã. Ri ikorha akɛrɛ unga atsu uvau ru upfunga nu unga awe uner uwuku ukpo ukam irhirhika iki iba ri imangmang.<verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang, Uibrahim aka adɔsu Unum ri ivangyɛ Unum aka adɛyiwe unga azĩ abĩ akase, akirakɛ unga aka abemuwe unga aka iwe uner ukam ake. Unga adɔsa azĩã, unga uwi anasi ihwɛnga anangkɛ unga aka izĩ. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang unga aka awu utsen asei ra abĩ hã Unum aka abemuwe, unga asei ru atsurha, unga nu Uishaku nu Uyakubu, aka akpo ukam ibibemuwe ha ru unga. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Uibrahim adɛ̃ɛ̃ idzɛu uteukpi Unum aka igbisha na adzin, uteu ha uwe ru atarh idzin aki ugbagbaa.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang Usaratu aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ amar ungwɛ̃ ri ikɔ̃ner, nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ unga awu ukpirh. Unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ amara ubinkutsu awea ri imangmang ugɛ uwuku ubemuwe ha awu uner idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Nggee ru ubok Uibrahim, uwuruwi aka akɔ̃ɔ̃ akpurha abɔr akpe, umbɔ amar anang arhɛrhɛ ru nyaki ídzɛr afã use ru nyaku uzuzeu ra abang ukau ukugɔng umbɔ aka asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ avarhumbɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Kishoo aner abɛrɛ asei ri imangmang. Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka akpe, asi iyɛimbɔ abinkɛ Unum aka abemuwe umbɔ, bɔr umbɔ anyãmbɔ abin hã uku ukaa na agũmbɔ ibɛn inyã ake. Ikɛi umbɔ abemumbɔ ugɛ umbɔ awu atsen na asi iwembɔ abi upfung. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Abirabɛ iki idzowe ikpũ ideka iyɛrɛ adɛyiwe ra awiya ugɛ umbɔ abee abĩ akimbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Umbɔ aba adɛ̃ɛ̃ ikaifɛrhkɔ ri itsi anangkɛ umbɔ aka abɔre, umbɔ awuri ikpombɔ ivang iyiki ibvui izĩ. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, umbɔ atsu amɛnmbɔ abee abĩ aka azea, akirakɛ aka awe ra afã. Nggee, Unum asi igũa atsa umbɔ ayisa unga ugɛ unga awu Unummbɔ, ubinkutsu unga aka agbishuka uteu ru umbɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang ivangyɛ Unum aka aviru Uibrahim, unga anɛmuwe Uishaku awu idɛm-Num. Unga aka ayɛi ibibemuwe ha, ibɔr uku ukpɛɛ unga afɛre unanyĩ ungwɛ̃nga, <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ Unum aka arherhunga nggu Uibrahim agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ru ubok Uishaku ungo uku ikpo unangwi umum iki ĩbemuwa ungo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Ing 21.12</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Uibrahim avarhe ra amɛnnga agɛ awu idzidzɛrhe Unum adɛ̃ɛ̃ azituka unga ra akpe. Unera adɛ̃ɛ̃ agɔra agɛ ungwɛ̃nga aka akpea na abvui aba ru unga.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang Uishaku aka atsuke idorh ru Uyakubu nu Isuwa ra abinkɛ aka iba ra asu.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang Uyakubu, ivangyɛ unga aka abee ikpe, unga atsuke idorh ra angwɛ̃ Uyusuf ikivarhambɔ. Unga asũrhĩ itsinga ri igbongnga na adzowe igɔng ru Unum.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang, ivang akpe Uyusuf iki iyo, unga arherha arherhe akika adzek abi Uisrairha ru Umasar, na adɛyiwe umbɔ ubinkpi umbɔ aka ikorhe nggu apfupfu iyornga.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang umbɔ abika amar Umusa awɔke unga afɛ̃ɛ̃ ataar, ubinkutsu umbɔ anyã ungwɛ̃ hã awuwea, ngge itsu umbɔ asi igũmbɔ iwei arherhe uyɛrhe.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang Umusa aka aseng, unga akpɛ̃ɛ̃ umbɔ ayisa unga agɛ ungwɛ̃ unapa Ufir'auna. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Unga asɛng ihwa ayetnum nggu aner Unum nu unga aka igũibɛn arhim ri ivang iyiki ici. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Unga abemu iyiyɛi ri itsok Ukiristo nu unga aka iwe ru kishoo abin akagɔng ru Umasar, ubinkutsu unga atsu amɛnnga ri itosanga.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang unga aka abɔre abĩ Umasar, asi igũa iwei avɔm uyɛrhe, abimunga ubinkutsu, unga anyã uwuruwi umbɔ aka asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ anyãmbɔ nggu asu. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang Umusa aka aden Irhowa Iyiki Igar Utɔng, unga akũ adzirh amisuwe, ngge itsú uwuruwi aka ifɛr akã angwɛ̃ asi íbangunga abi Uisrairha.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang abi Uisrairha aka agar Ukau Ukpuku Ubãrhã ru nyaka abĩ aka akoyi, bɔr ivangyɛ abi Umasar aka abee igar, amɛ̃ afɛre umbɔ.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang ufɔm uteu Ujeriko uku ugba ru uzɛ̃rhãmbɔ aka adzipu ufɔm hã inuma utɔɔva.<verse eid="HEB 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang Urahab unggoyi ha, umbɔ aka asi ifɛrmbɔ unga nggu abika akpɛ̃ɛ̃ Unum, ubinkutsu unga ayɛisa abika azĩ arhi abĩ hã ri iwɔk.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Nu umum ibvui irherhu use? Ishimum ri ivang iyiki irherha arherhe ri itsi Ugidiyon, Ubarak, Usamson, Ujefta, Udauda, Usamairha, nu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num hã. <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>Awe ru ubok imangmang abɛrɛ ha aka agha unggbaashi nu íyɛrhe, atɔ̃ itser iyiki irhika, ayɛi abinkɛ umbɔ aka abemuwe, abvure angwĩ utɛ̃rhĩmi, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>irhiwuwe igigar ikon urha, umbɔ ashɔɔr ri ighigha akon akika ader, atsu ighɛpa iwu iker ru umbɔ, awe abika aker ri iwa, na atsu abi iwa abĩ akase atĩ. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Akatsɛrh ayɛimbɔ anermbɔ aka akpe na asok nggu urhɛ. Abɔɔ akwɛre umbɔ ugwɛɛ. Abika ayɛi ugwɛɛ ha asi ibeembɔ umbɔ atsũwe umbɔ ngge itsú umbɔ abvui asok nggu urhɛ uku uzea. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Arhena abɔɔ na akwɛre umbɔ ugwɛɛ nggu asharhe, umbɔ akũ inyãwã abow umbɔ na atsuke umbɔ ru ugborzĩ. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Atang atarh ru umbɔ, akũ ikon iki izharha acucii agasha umbɔ agbɛra avaa, na afɛre umbɔ nggu akon aka ader. Atsim abvur itsurhi nu aki ibũ, ashimbɔ ru ubin. Asei ra ayetnum nu anera akorhuwe umbɔ iyiki ibewe, <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>ayarhe ri inang uzuzeu nu ikɛi atsi igũ nu atai nu ingwĩ aki iwe ra abĩ. Irhirhika anera ru upfunga isi iyongge iyi abɛrɛ ha.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ Unum adzowuka ideka iyiki ize ri imangmangmbɔ, umbɔ asi iyɛimbɔ ubinkpi Unum aka abemuwe. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Unum agbisha abin aka azea ru umɛn, ngge itsú umɛn nggu umbɔ iwe uku kpengkpeng urhɔnga.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Abɛrɛ ha kishoo aka adɛyiwe ugɛ umbɔ awembɔ ri imangmang ru Unum, ikɛi umbɔ ani izɛrha umɛn kishoo. Nggee umɛn itare abina kishoo aka ikɛn umɛn, nu ikɛi ubɛn arhimkɛ aka akpɔm umɛn uku ugbong. Umɛn ibima ni ikorhu ubɛn abinkɛ Unum aka adzaa umɛn ikorhe. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Umɛn itsu asumɛn ru Uyesu, unga awu uwuruwi aka adzaa umɛn imangmang ikɛi unga awuri iyika umɛn ngge itsuifɛr. Unga asi ibemunga atsa igãrhãmau ucucii ha, bɔr unga abima ngge, ubinkutsu unga ahwɛnga anggɔmkɛ aka iba. Icɛrɛ unga asei nu ubok ugha anang isei Unum. <verse eid="HEB 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Àka arhi anyã utsak uwurɛ aka abima ikpikpɛ̃ɛ̃ abi arhim, ngge itsú umbi asi ígũmbi azhe use atsũwũkumbi amɛnmbi.<verse eid="HEB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Unum amesuwe amɛn ra angwɛ̃nga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Ri ititɛ̃wãmbi nggu arhim, umbi anasi itɛ̃wã atsĩmbi iyi akpe. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Umbi aka ayirukumbi ififitayɛ umbɔ aka akorhuwa umbi ru nyaka angwɛ̃nga ri itsɛng Arherhu-Num? Unga agɔr agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">&lt;&lt;A ungwɛ̃mum, niba ukwɛɛrkɔ imesuwe amɛn iyi Uteijee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">Niba utsũwũkɔ amɛnngo unga aba atsɛrhunga ungo.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Ubinkutsu Uteijee aka isaka amesuwe amɛn ru abirabɛ unga aka abema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">na amesuwe amɛn ra abirabɛ unga aka ayɛi umbɔ awu angwɛ̃nga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:11">Uny 3.11</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 3:12">12</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Àka abima nggu ayetnum, ubinkutsu, ake awe imesuwe amɛn Unum aka akorhuwa umbi ru nyaka angwɛ̃. Ungwɛ̃ uwukusong utɛnga asi imesuka unga amɛn? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Awuri imesukumbɔ amɛn ru ubɛn uwɛkuci. Uba umbɔ asi imesuwambɔ umbi amɛn, umbi awu abirabɛ umbɔ aka amar ru ugba, umbi asi iwembi angwɛ̃nga abi idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Ikɛi, umɛn iwemɛn ra atesmɛn abi upfung umbɔ iki imesuwa umɛn amɛn, umɛn iki isaki idzowe umbɔ imor. Imɛ̃ngge umɛn igbishi iyɛi imesa iyi Utei uwu ípfu inangmɛn iyi upfung ru umɛn iwe ru urhɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Atesmɛn abi upfung amesuwa umɛn amɛn ri ivanga ukunjiir ru ubinkpi umbɔ aka anyã ukpɔ urhika, bɔr Unum amesuwa umɛn amɛn ru iyiki ize umɛn, ngge itsú umɛn ima ikpo ugau ri isisar iyinga. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Ri ivang imesa amɛn hã umɛn isi isaki ĩgũmɛn ibɛn, umɛn ini igũ ighong. Bɔr akɛrɛ ha aba amaake, abirabɛ aka ayɛi imesuwe amɛn hã, irhirhikayɛ umbɔ aka akpo ri imesuwe amɛn hã iwuri itsu umbɔ akpo ididɔɔr.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Nggee, àka abera abokmbi akika agũ azhe na atsu atsurhukmbi akika agũ azhe aker. <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Àka avi atsĩndĩmbi arhika, ngge itsú andaidakmbi akika asheri iker niba akhɔruke, bɔr awuri ikerhuke.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igbiir ato nu ififita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Àka abee utsĩndĩ uwuku asei uku ughwɔɔw nggu anera kishoo na awu asasar, ubinkutsu isisar iba ishingge unera asi ínyãã Uteijee. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Àka angwɛ̃dzɛn utsur unera asi ikpoa imimutu Unum na niba neke ikpere iseng itsu ayetnum ni idakuwe amɛn anera arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Unera niba awea ra anyɔna use uwuku usheri iwei Unum ru nyaku Uisuwa, uwuruwi aka agoshe ugau ukam ikɔ̃ner ukã ungwɛ̃ ngge itsú unga ayɛi utubin ubingha unying. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Ru nyaka umbi aka ahwɛng, unga aka abee iyɛi ukam idorh ha iyi ukã ungwɛ̃, bɔr umbɔ akpɛ̃mbɔ unga. Unga asi ikpoa ivang iyiki igbisha, nggayɛ unga abee idorh ha nggu anyĩ.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igũ iyi iwei nu igũ iyi anggɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Umbi anasi ibambi ri Igũ Usinai iyiriyɛ umbɔ aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ abanga, iyiriyɛ iki ikpĩĩ nggu urha nu uzĩ uku ugburhuk nu ufin inai nu ugba uku uker <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>nu ibar utsom nu urhɛmkpi uku itsu abika agũ ukpɔ ashɔ̃rhã agɛ ukpɔ niba ubvui urherhukpɔ arherhe nggu umbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Ubinkutsu, umbɔ asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ abimumbɔ nggu itsitsu ha iki igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Uko ijuɛ iba ibangungge igũ hã, awu ufang umbɔ afɛr ngge nggu atarh.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:12">Idzi 19.12</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:13">13</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Abin hã umbɔ aka anyã awu abin iwei akarhãrhã utsɛku Umusa aka agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Iwei itsu iyormum izang.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Iva 9.19</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Bɔr umbi aba ri Igũ Usihiyona, ru uteu Unum uwu urhɛ ukpurukpi uku uwe Urusharhima uwu afã, anangkɛ ikikɔng ípfu itser-Num anera aka asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ avarhumbɔ iki igɔmanggɔm. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>Anang hã awu anangkɛ ikikɔng akã angwɛ̃ abika adɔsa aka awe, abirabɛ atsokmbɔ aka atsɛng ra afã. Umbi aba ru Unum uwuku utsu uvau anera kishoo, nu ípfu abika arhika umbɔ aka awu uku kpengkpeng. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Umbi aba ru Uyesu uwuruwi aka atsu ibibemuwe-Num iyiki ifa iwe ru ubok adzirhnga hã umbɔ aka amisuwe ake ri itsũwe arhim. Adzirh ha arherha arherhe aka aze anangke adzirh Uhabirha.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Àka arhi utsur umbi akpɛ̃mbi unga uwuku urherha arherhe. Ubinkutsu umbɔ aba asi ishɔɔrmbɔ ri ivangyɛ umbɔ aka akpɛ̃ uwuku udzowe umbɔ isarhe iyiki igbiir ato ru upfung, umɛn isi íshɔɔrmɛn, umɛn ĩba ikpɛ̃mɛn uwu ha aka adzaa umɛn isarhe ha iyiki idzeka afã. <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Ri ivang hã Unum aka arherha arherhe ri Igũ Usinai, urhɛmnga uzusuwe abĩã, bɔr icɛrɛ unga aka abemuwanga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum izusu abĩã idiki unying, ikɛi asi íwea abĩ ukpekũ, bɔr nggu afã.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Uhag 2.6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Irhɛm hã, &lt;&lt;Idiki unying ikɛi,&gt;&gt; idɛyiwa itsũwe abinkɛ umbɔ aka amuna aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ izusa awuri itsũwe ake. Ngge itsú abinkɛ aka asi ízusuke ama abɔr. <verse eid="HEB 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Nggee, umɛn itar uwɛɛ ubinkutsu, umɛn iki iyɛimɛn Iyɛrhayɛ iki isi ízusungge. Ikɛi umɛn idzowe igɔng Unum nggu iwei nu imoryɛ unga aka abee, <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>ubinkutsu &lt;&lt;Unummɛn awu urha ukpuku ukpĩĩwe.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Iva 4.24</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Ififita iyiki imasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Àka abema adɔka ru nyaka angwɛ̃ uyi. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Niba ayirukumbi iyɛi atsen, ubinkutsu ikorhe rimi hã itsu abɔɔ ayɛi ípfu itser-Num na asi ihwɛngmbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Àka ayita abi ugborzĩ ugɛɛ abow umbi urhɔnga, nu abika ahwa ayetnum ugɛɛ umbi anu ihwa urhɔnga.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Umbi kishoo àka adzowe imor ri ipfuna. Ukutsɛrh nggu ukutsak awe ru idzidzɛrhe ra adɔka, ubinkutsu Unum awuri itsu uvau ru ubɛn unerwi aka atoma-dak use irha nggu unerwi unga aka asi ipfununga. <verse eid="HEB 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Àka atsũwe amɛnmbi ri ibemu uhwɛk, àka ashur nggu ubinkpi umbi aka awerakpɔ. Ubinkutsu, Unum aka agɔra agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">&lt;&lt;Umum isi ínekamum umbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">isi ítsũwãmum umbi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Iva 31.6</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Nggee umɛn irherhe nggu ikeramɛn igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">&lt;&lt;Uteijee unga awu uwuku iyika umum, umum isi ígũmum iwei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Unera adɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhuwa umum use?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Amb 118.6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:7">7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Àka ayita anggbaashimbi abika amesuwa umbi Arherhu-Num. Àka arhi ikpũ isiseimbɔ na amesi imangmangmbɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Uyesu Ukiristo asi ífarunga! Unga awe ru nyaka ha arhɛkɛ nu irherɛ nu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Niba neke imesa iyikise inyangungge amɛnmbi. Azea umbi akpo ififita ri imimutu Unum, asi iwea ri imesa ri itsi abingha, iyiriyɛ iki isi iyikungge abika atsu amɛnmbɔ ru ngge.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Umɛn iwemɛn ru ubeu ha abika adzowe idɛm-Num ru utsurha ashimbɔ ri ijee iyiki igha ubin umɔ. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Ukugɔng Uwuku Udzowe Idɛm-Num aka isaka akũ adzirh atsĩ ra Anankɛ Aka Asar Anangke Ananga Kishoo awe idɛm-Num arhim, bɔr ijuɛɛ umbɔ akpĩĩwe ru undzing utepa. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Ngge itsu Uyesu ikɛi aka ahwa ayetnum ru undzing utepa atsu anera asar nggu adzirhnga. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Awu ufang umɛn idze izĩ ru unga ru undzing utepa ni igasha ra atsakɛ unga aka abima. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Ubinkutsu umɛn ishimɛn ru uteu ukpu ugbagbaa ru upfung ukpirɛ, bɔr umɛn itsu asumɛn idzɛu uteukpi uku iba.<verse eid="HEB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Nggee, umɛn idzowe ikpikpoi ru Unum ru nyaki idɛm-Nummɛn ru ubok Uyesu, iyiriyɛ iki iwe izũwãyɛ umbɔ aka adzowe ra angwĩ na agɔr agɛ unga awu Uteijeemɛn. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Na niba ayirukumbi ikorhe iyiki ize na agashu ubinkpi umbi aka awerakpɔ nggu adɔka, ubinkutsu ikpũ idɛm-Num iyɛrɛ itsu Unum agũibɛn.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Àka adɔsa anggbaashimbi na akorhu ubinkpi umbɔ aka agɔr, ngge itsú umbɔ akorha akɛrɛ nggu anggɔm, asi íwea nggu ibvun arherhe, iyiriyɛ iki isi íyikangge umbi. Ubinkutsu umbɔ anu idzɛu umbi nu umbɔ awuri avarhuwe irhɛ itsermbɔ ru Unum.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Àka afɛna-Num ru umɛn. Umɛn ihwɛngmɛn umɛn ishimɛn ru uvau ru ubɛn utsĩndĩã, nu umɛn ibee ikorha abinkɛ aka arhika ra abina kishoo. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Umum ĩdzumi ibee afɛn-Num ĩgɛ Unum ama atsu umum ibvui ĩba ru umbi ififitem.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Idorh nu imimasha ighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Unum uwu ididɔɔr unga asoyiwe Uteijeemɛn Uyesu ra akpe, uner idzɛu idɔi uwuku ugɔng, ru ubok adzirh ibibemuwe-Num iyi ugbagbaa. <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>Unga ama adzaa umbi kishoo abina akaze ngge itsú umbi akorha abinkɛ unga aka abee, na atɔ̃ itser ru umɛn iki itsu unga agũibɛn, ru ubok Uyesu Ukiristo. Ikpikpoi izĩ ru unga ugbagbaa. Iwerimi.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, umum ishɔ̃rhã umbi aka akpeto ri ififitayɛ umum iki itsɛnga umbi, ubinkutsu umum itsɛnga umbi ukunjiir.<verse eid="HEB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Umum ibee umbi ihwɛng ugɛ ungwɛ̃mɛn Utimoti aka adzeka ru ugborzĩ. Unga aba abanga nggimi ifitem, umum uwuri ikũ nggu unga ivangyɛ umum iki iba iyepa umbi.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Àka aghwe anggbaashimbi kishoo nu kishoo abika adɔsa ungɔmɔ. Abika adɔsa ra abi Uitarhiya aghwe umbi.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Imimutu Unum ima iwe nggu umbi kishoo.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
